From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rhnvrm <hello@rohanverma.net>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:01:08 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] perf: batch history reaction cache misses

Read cached reactions once per post and fetch misses in bounded SQL batches.
Preserve empty results, legacy timestamps, remote fields, cache invalidation
and metadata filtering. Fall back to per-post reads if a bulk read fails.
Single-post and nested permalink preparation keep their existing lookups.

Add store/cache/app regressions and a real history-page benchmark. Regenerate
store layers and mocks. Existing feature patches and authorship are unchanged.

Mattermax-Patch: reaction-history-batches.patch
